### Root
GET {{url}}/

### Helpers - Database Connection Status
GET {{url}}/helpers

### Auth - Admin Login
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "admin12345"
}

### Auth - Register (email & password manual)
# @name register
POST {{url}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Andri",
  "email": "andri@example.com",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}

### Auth - Login
# @name login
POST {{url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "andri@example.com",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}

### Auth - Login Admin (hasil seed)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "admin12345"
}

### Users - Me (butuh Bearer token)
GET {{url}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Users - Update Profile
PATCH {{url}}/users/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Andri",
  "phone": "08123456789",
  "bio": "Fullstack developer",
  "avatarUrl": "https://example.com/avatar.png",
  "location": "Jakarta"
}

### Users - Connected Accounts
GET {{url}}/users/me/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Categories - Create
POST {{url}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Undangan Digital",
  "slug": "undangan-digital",
  "icon": "📨",
  "description": "Template undangan pernikahan, ulang tahun, dan acara lainnya",
  "sortOrder": 1,
  "isActive": true
}

### Categories - List All
GET {{url}}/categories

### Categories - Get One
GET {{url}}/categories/{{categoryId}}

### Categories - Update
PATCH {{url}}/categories/{{categoryId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Undangan Digital Premium",
  "sortOrder": 0
}

### Categories - Delete
DELETE {{url}}/categories/{{categoryId}}
